  itemID: doc4.1
  itemName: Valentino's Journal - Entry 4 (of 5)
  itemType: 1
  icon: {fileID: -811217553, guid: 44bb429c66c7df816b55d41878254ce0, type: 3}
  description: 
  fileText: '"The woman who drew up the co-ownership papers - Madeleine Noir - I
    have not seen her in eleven years. I thought she was gone. I thought what we
    signed was ordinary business. But I''ve been reading the founding terms carefully
    and there are clauses I don''t remember agreeing to. Clauses about people. About
    relationships. About what happens if certain conditions change."'
